; One row, a reader and a taker.  A joint bag forbids a member reading what
; another takes; a synchronous bag allows it (both see the entry state); one
; order runs (read, then take) and the other does not, so they are no round.
(r)
(rule look (read (r)) (absent (seen)) (make (seen)))
(rule grab (take (r)) (make (gone)))
